        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bronze bell tower has risen above Greece. Its toll turns everything around—forests, fields, even people—into cold metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lead a team of brave heroes to stop this curse. The journey will take you across distant islands, into deep caves, ancient forests, and endless plains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only wisdom and determination can withstand the bronze chime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about the fragility of life, the cost of leadership, and the hope strong enough to resist a sound that turns the world to stone and bronze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argonaut Agency is a time-management game with worker assignment: on each level you quickly gather resources (food, wood, etc.), build and upgrade structures (farm, sawmill, workers’ house), clear obstacles, and manage to complete the objectives for ‘3 stars’ before the timer runs out, using temporary boosts (speed-up, time stop, construction speed-up).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The return of beloved heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Friend or foe? Talos bursts into the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. A thrilling and epic story of Argonauts clashing with the bronze giant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Enchanting music that evokes memories of Ancient Greece!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.Engaging and varied mechanics in each new location!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.Action-packed comic-style cutscenes full of intense battles!</p>",
